15 workers working 8 hours per day complete a job in 12 days. How many days will 20 workers working 6 hours per day take?

10 days
12 days
15 days
16 days
Solution:

Workers₁ = 15
Hours₁ = 8
Days₁ = 12
Workers₂ = 20
Hours₂ = 6
Days₂ = ?
W_1 *H_1 * D_1 = W_2 * H_2 * D_2
15*8*12 = 20*6*x
x=12days
Answer: Option B
